The four cells below repeat the summary of section 6 after sections 7\[Dash]9 \
have been evaluated, so they cover every check of the notebook.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"df8ad94b-c3ea-ad48-a1d5-3576100cdd01"],

